# Every file in this directory is a byte-for-byte vendored copy whose SHA-256 is
# asserted by MANIFEST.sha256 and by src/generator/scad.test.ts. Twelve of the
# .scad sources are CRLF upstream and fifteen have no trailing newline, so any
# EOL normalisation — a future `* text=auto` at the repo root, or a checkout on
# Windows — would rewrite the bytes, break every hash, and produce a diff that
# looks like tampering. `-text` disables that conversion for good. Diffs are
# still text diffs; only the line-ending rewriting is off.
* -text
